# E §5 step 3, L §5.14.3 Detection (tally 2.1.2, issue #34, the user's "A: the refusal spreads"): late (known 2026-05-01)
# re-measures rent[2026-03] at 0 tenants, so its amount is refused (RUN-DIV). The adjustment adjustments[rent[2026-03].cash,
# late] is refused, and so is what an unsettled one reaches: flows of rent over a span reaching 2026-05-01, and konto's
# balance from then (q); a read before it stands (before). A binding over adjustments holds it (n); a sum of its change
# is refused (s); explain prints it (e2). tally 2.1.1's refcore skipped the step: q was (500.00 PLN, 7 000.00 PLN), as if
# late changed nothing.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source act "act"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place landlord: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input total: money PLN
input tenants[m in months]: int
input dom: int

move rent[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to landlord amount round(total / tenants[m], minor(PLN), half-even)

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  total = 1 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  dom = 10 "umowa"
  tenants[*] = 2 "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 10 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version late
  cite act
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-05-01
  replace tenants[*] = 0 "aneks"

ask before: bal(konto, 2026-04-30)
ask q: flows(rent, 2026-05-01 .. 2026-05-31), bal(konto, 2026-06-30)
ask n: count(x in adjustments over 2026)
ask s: sum(x.change for x in adjustments over 2026)
ask e2: explain rent[2026-03]
=== expect
before: 8 000.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-04]
  cut 2026-10-20
e2: rent[2026-03]
  plan, day 2026-03-10, booking cut 2026-03-10, status past
  leg cash from konto to landlord amount 500.00 PLN
  derivation at 2026-03-10:
    [1] row plan_2026:dom = 10
        version plan_2026, source plan, "plan", locator "umowa", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
    [2] row plan_2026:total = 1 000.00 PLN
        version plan_2026, source plan, "plan", locator "umowa", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
    [3] row plan_2026:tenants = 2
        version plan_2026, source plan, "plan", locator "umowa", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
  adjustment adjustments[rent[2026-03].cash, late]: change refused: RUN-DIV division by zero on 2026-05-01 (version late)
  cut 2026-10-20
n: 1
  cut 2026-10-20
q: (refused: RUN-DIV division by zero, refused: RUN-DIV division by zero)
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: rent[2026-06]
  cut 2026-10-20
s: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  cut 2026-10-20
